# Supply-chain hardening (v1.0.0-infosec-signoff, G18).
# Refuse to run ANY package lifecycle script (preinstall/install/postinstall) on `npm ci`/`npm install`.
# A future malicious transitive dependency cannot execute code merely by being installed.
# NOTE: this also suppresses THIS package's own lifecycle hooks -- so every build/typecheck the
# release depends on is invoked as an EXPLICIT step in CI (see .github/workflows/supply-chain.yml
# and conformance.yml, which run `npm run typecheck`/`npm run build` directly), never via a
# prepare/postinstall hook. The supply-chain workflow asserts this file keeps ignore-scripts=true.
ignore-scripts=true
